    "sentence_translations": [
      "Using an umbrella on a sunny day",
      "",
      "The weather was very nice. Lin Hong and Paul planned to go shopping.",
      "When they left home, Lin Hong brought an umbrella.",
      "Paul thought it was strange and he asked, “It’s sunny today. Why do you bring an umbrella?”",
      "Lin Hong said, “This is not an umbrella. It’s a parasol.”",
      "“The sunshine is too strong today. I might get a tan if I don’t use the parasol. ”",
      "On the street Paul saw many girls using parasols.",
      "He said, “Chinese people are so different from western people.”",
      "“All western people want to get a tan, while Chinese people are afraid of being tanned.”"
    ]
